    "wire": "Update owner metadata is an optional canonical UUID outside set; omitted unchanged, null invalid; empty set/unset permits owner-only update.",
    "authorization": "Current active caller, tenant, credential and Update grant; both old and destination owners accessible before CAS and final publication. No extra Read grant.",
