    "generated": "All managed output owners and versions follow producer; role IDs/reservations and unrelated referenced/business root owners remain stable.",
    "indexes": "Public owner_records move exactly old to new partition; both owner/contract epochs fence cursors. Private outputs stay outside public owner index.",
    "noops": "Same-owner unchanged-input edits retain data/index/root revisions and conflict guards; operation receipts remain durable.",
    "composition": "Immediately staged queries/roles/outputs support create, retarget or earlier producer deletion followed by transfer in one Attempt.",
    "effects": "Pinned requester, intent and durable facts preserved; existing worker authority/disclosure and fact application boundaries retained; application cannot author owner metadata.",
